license: MPL-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-17"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24313648
abstract: >-
  An HTM implementation in Pony: encoders, spatial pooler, temporal memory, SDR
  classifier and streaming anomaly detection, each running in process and on
  actors.
keywords:
  - HTM
  - hierarchical temporal memory
  - spatial pooler
  - temporal memory
  - anomaly detection
  - Pony
